# Shadow fleet reports are generated from live inventory and carry production
# VINs. They are regenerable (scripts/market-shadow-report.ts) and go stale the
# moment the lot moves, so they are read locally and never committed.
MARKET_V2_SHADOW_FLEET_REPORT*.md

# Generated gate reports and shadow fleet runs stay out of the repository.
GATE_*_REPORT.md
MARKET_V2_SHADOW_FLEET_REPORT*.md
